        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fonji pa Yohana Jakibatisa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I oro mar'apar g'abic ma dhum pa Kayisar Tiberio, munyo Ponsio Pilato dhumo paka gavana ma Yuda, kareno Herode rwoth ma Galili, aka omin go Filipo oyido obedo jadhum ma Itureya gi Trakoniti, kareno Lisania oyido obedo jadhum ma Abilene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i ndir pa jodongo pa jocway ri Were i wi migam Anas jokodi Kaifas, wac pa Were obino ri Yohana wod pa Zekaria i thim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go owotho i piny ma Yordan gibe ka fonjo kwoŋ batisimo ma ŋuto kodi limo cwak kwoŋ reco, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.3+ISA.40.4+ISA.40.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 40:3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "paka ondiki i kitawo pa Isaya jatuci wac Were ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
